{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54188","headline":"青城暮雨 · 皮日休","name":"青城暮雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草树连云雉堞平，萧萧风雨暗荒城。\n流归涧壑应无色，响入松杉觉有声。\n旅邸愁人宁复梦，书堂倦客若爲情。\n芭蕉滴沥伤心处，俯仰空怀一笑名。\n（以上三首均见《古今图书集成·职方典》卷一一四七《安陆府部》。\n疑僞。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}